@PillApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5227

### Health check
GET {{PillApp.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Ricerca farmaci (paginata, minimo 3 caratteri)
GET {{PillApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/farmaci/search?q=paracetamolo&limit=20&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Lookup per AIC
GET {{PillApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/farmaci/012345678
Accept: application/json

### Keepalive database (usato dal workflow GitHub Actions)
GET {{PillApp.Api_HostAddress}}/keepalive-db
X-KEEPALIVE: local-keepalive-secret
Accept: application/json
